{"text": "Alice was sitting by the river with her sister. She was bored, because her sister's book had no pictures. Suddenly, a White Rabbit with a pocket watch ran past. 'Oh dear! I shall be late!' he said. Alice ran after the Rabbit and saw him jump into a big rabbit hole. She jumped in too, and she fell down, down, down, past cupboards, maps and jars. At the bottom, she found a tiny golden key and a very small door to a beautiful garden. Then she found a little bottle. 'Drink me,' it said. Alice drank it, and she became very small!", "words": [[0.43, 0.78], [0.78, 0.9], [0.9, 1.25], [1.25, 1.43], [1.43, 1.55], [1.55, 1.88], [1.88, 2.04], [2.04, 2.15], [2.15, 3.1], [3.26, 3.41], [3.41, 3.59], [3.59, 4.02], [4.06, 4.29], [4.29, 4.4], [4.4, 4.8], [4.8, 5.1], [5.1, 5.3], [5.3, 5.5], [5.5, 6.28], [7.68, 8.13], [8.18, 8.29], [8.29, 8.63], [8.63, 9.02], [9.02, 9.12], [9.12, 9.18], [9.18, 9.61], [9.61, 9.91], [9.91, 10.13], [10.13, 11.03], [11.25, 11.47], [11.47, 11.85], [11.93, 12.08], [12.08, 12.22], [12.22, 12.35], [12.35, 12.88], [13.0, 13.14], [13.14, 13.6], [14.98, 15.35], [15.35, 15.6], [15.6, 15.86], [15.86, 15.95], [15.95, 16.61], [16.61, 16.78], [16.78, 16.96], [16.96, 17.16], [17.16, 17.49], [17.49, 17.71], [17.71, 17.78], [17.78, 18.0], [18.0, 18.32], [18.32, 18.76], [20.14, 20.26], [20.26, 20.57], [20.57, 20.75], [20.75, 21.29], [21.36, 21.49], [21.49, 21.61], [21.61, 21.83], [21.83, 22.16], [22.21, 22.51], [22.56, 22.91], [22.96, 23.33], [23.33, 23.73], [23.79, 24.15], [24.15, 24.26], [24.26, 24.86], [26.21, 26.35], [26.35, 26.43], [26.43, 27.01], [27.1, 27.24], [27.24, 27.52], [27.52, 27.6], [27.6, 28.04], [28.04, 28.45], [28.45, 29.1], [29.1, 29.22], [29.22, 29.29], [29.29, 29.57], [29.57, 29.93], [29.93, 30.23], [30.23, 30.35], [30.35, 30.41], [30.41, 30.88], [30.88, 31.44], [32.79, 32.99], [32.99, 33.11], [33.11, 33.4], [33.4, 33.45], [33.45, 33.72], [33.72, 34.49], [34.69, 34.99], [34.99, 35.27], [35.37, 35.53], [35.53, 36.16], [36.33, 36.66], [36.66, 